  "definition": "Early Childhood Special Education Teacher",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-11",
  "historyNote": "#9991, eff 9-16-11; renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.391), EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #12898, INTERIM, eff 10-11-19, EXPIRED: 4-8-20 New. #13023, Emergency Rule, eff 4-9-20, EXPIRES: 10-6-20; ss by #13099, eff 9-11-20",
